  "registrationGroupTitle": "Registration and sign-in",
  "@registrationGroupTitle": {
    "description": "Heading of the group of server settings about how people join the server and sign in: whether they may create an account, change their username or reset a forgotten password, how long a reset link works, and how a sign-in provider is linked to an account."
